OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at former
OL,4,Arestaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire has gutted a former
OL,7,Frestaurant in North Yorkshire.
OL,9,FMultiple fire crews were called out to
OL,10,Fthe blaze on Old Great North Road in
OL,11,FBrotherton at about 22:15 BST on
OL,12,FMonday.
OL,14,FThe empty building had previously been
OL,15,Foccupied by Thaal Indian Restaurant,
OL,16,Fwhich closed its doors in February
OL,17,Fafter 20 years at the site.
OL,19,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,20,Fhad earlier urged people living nearby
OL,21,Fto keep windows shut.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
